<doc id="151225" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=151225" title="Maximilian Philipp">
Maximilian Philipp

Maximilian Philipp (lair tanggal 1 Maret 1994) ya iku pemain &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; sing main kanggo &lt;a href="Borussia%20Dortmund"&gt;Borussia Dortmund&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Bundesliga"&gt;Bundesliga&lt;/a&gt;.
