Jasirah

Jasirah utawa ujung (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: paeninsula) ya iku sebidang lemah kang njorok ning lautan lan diubengi déning banyu. Kaya ta, &lt;a href="Jasirah%20Florida"&gt;Jasirah Florida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jasirah%20Malaya"&gt;Jasirah Malaya&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Jasirah%20Skandinavia"&gt;Jasirah Skandinavia&lt;/a&gt;. Banyu kang ngubengi jasirah biasané permanen (mesti ana banyuné; ora tau asat). Jasirah nduwèni dasanama, kaya ta, &lt;a href="headlands%20and%20bays"&gt;headland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cape%20%28geography%29"&gt;cape&lt;/a&gt;, island &lt;a href="promontory"&gt;promontory&lt;/a&gt;, bill, point, utawa &lt;a href="spit%20%28landform%29"&gt;spit&lt;/a&gt;. Saben-saben jasirah nduwèni pucuk, kang karan tanjung. Ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggeris&lt;/a&gt; tembung jamak saka jasirah yaiku peninsulas utawa peninsulae.
Jasirah uga nduwèni laladan sempit kang diapit déning loro badan air kang cedhak. Laladan sempit iki uga kasebut &lt;a href="laladan%20genting"&gt;laladan genting&lt;/a&gt;.
