<doc id="152775" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=152775" title="Tarékat Qodiriyah">
Tarékat Qodiriyah

Tarékat Qodiriyah (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: القادريه‎‎, &lt;a href="Basa%20P%C3%A8rsi"&gt;Pèrsi&lt;/a&gt;: قادریه‎‎, ugi saged dipunsebat Qadri, Qadriya, Kadri, Elkadri, Elkadry, Aladray, Alkadrie, Adray, Kadray, Qadiri,"Quadri" utawi Qadri), inggih menika satunggaling &lt;a href="tar%C3%A9kat"&gt;tarékat&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sufi"&gt;sufi&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipungulawenthah déning &lt;a href="ulama"&gt;ulama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Syekh%20Abdul%20Qadir%20Jaelani"&gt;Syeikh Muhyidin Abu Muhammad Abdul Qodir Jaelani Al Baghdadi QS&lt;/a&gt; (1077-1166) utawi misuwur kanthi asma Syekh Abdul Qadir Jaelani ingkang asalipun saking &lt;a href="Gilan"&gt;Gilan&lt;/a&gt;. Ajaran utawi piwulang ing tarékat menika gumantung sanget kaliyan kepatuhan nindakaken amalan dhasar-dhasar agami &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;.
Tarékat kasebat, ingkang gadhah pang utawi cabang ingkang kathah, kasebar ing saindhenging donya, utaminipun ing donya ingkang nganggé &lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt;, lan ugi kasebar ing negara &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Afghanistan"&gt;Afghanistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bangladesh"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Balkan"&gt;Balkan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Palestina"&gt;Palestina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Israel"&gt;Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="China"&gt;China&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Afrika%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Afrika Wétan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="kulon"&gt;kilèn&lt;/a&gt;.
